<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1807733323"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:12.669"><div begin="18.796" end="1:09.896" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="18.796" end="32.095" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.796" end="19.562">窗外</span><span begin="19.562" end="20.353">雪</span><span begin="20.353" end="20.798">地的</span><span begin="20.798" end="21.346">纯</span><span begin="21.346" end="25.270">白</span> <span begin="25.874" end="26.661">被谁</span><span begin="26.661" end="27.162">燃</span><span begin="27.162" end="27.389">起</span><span begin="27.389" end="28.295">灰烬</span><span begin="28.295" end="28.953">覆</span><span begin="28.953" end="32.095">盖</span></p><p begin="32.819" end="38.350" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.819" end="33.511">再踏</span><span begin="33.511" end="34.176">上</span><span begin="34.270" end="34.597">新</span><span begin="34.597" end="35.109">的</span><span begin="35.109" end="35.415">旅</span><span begin="35.415" end="38.350">途</span></p><p begin="38.635" end="45.250" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.635" end="39.580">足迹有深</span><span begin="39.580" end="40.116">也有</span><span begin="40.116" end="40.563">浅</span> <span begin="40.563" end="40.792">都</span><span begin="40.792" end="41.194">消</span><span begin="41.194" end="41.454">逝</span><span begin="41.454" end="41.628">在</span><span begin="41.628" end="42.247">茫茫</span><span begin="42.247" end="42.551">人</span><span begin="42.551" end="45.250">海</span></p><p begin="45.814" end="52.461" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.814" end="46.314">关于</span><span begin="46.314" end="46.987">无常和</span><span begin="46.987" end="47.158">永</span><span begin="47.158" end="47.597">恒</span> <span begin="47.597" end="47.763">我</span><span begin="47.763" end="48.479">试着</span><span begin="48.479" end="48.946">接受</span><span begin="48.946" end="49.664">去瞭</span><span begin="49.664" end="52.461">解</span></p><p begin="52.836" end="56.271" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.836" end="53.269">爱的</span><span begin="53.269" end="53.776">勇敢或</span><span begin="53.776" end="54.134">软</span><span begin="54.134" end="54.545">弱</span> <span begin="54.545" end="55.462">决定</span><span begin="55.462" end="55.567">在</span><span begin="55.567" end="55.697">一</span><span begin="55.697" end="56.027">瞬</span><span begin="56.027" end="56.271">间</span></p><p begin="56.430" end="59.614" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.430" end="56.769">必须</span><span begin="56.769" end="57.081">甩</span><span begin="57.081" end="57.251">开</span><span begin="57.251" end="57.698">所有</span><span begin="57.698" end="57.954">的</span><span begin="57.954" end="58.344">纠</span><span begin="58.344" end="59.614">结</span></p><p begin="59.872" end="1:09.896" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.872" end="1:00.779">才能走向</span><span begin="1:00.779" end="1:01.217">天高</span><span begin="1:01.217" end="1:01.655">和</span><span begin="1:01.655" end="1:01.932">地</span><span begin="1:01.932" end="1:02.670">阔</span> <span begin="1:03.008" end="1:03.746">走向</span><span begin="1:03.746" end="1:09.896">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.869" end="1:43.750" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.869" end="1:17.587" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.869" end="1:11.709">让爱</span><span begin="1:11.709" end="1:12.105">走</span><span begin="1:12.105" end="1:12.543">下</span><span begin="1:12.543" end="1:13.705">去</span> <span begin="1:14.076" end="1:15.292">哪怕一路</span><span begin="1:15.292" end="1:15.791">都</span><span begin="1:15.791" end="1:16.108">怀</span><span begin="1:16.108" end="1:17.587">疑</span></p><p begin="1:17.954" end="1:24.788" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.954" end="1:19.098">永远都</span><span begin="1:19.098" end="1:19.537">有</span><span begin="1:19.537" end="1:20.868">你</span> <span begin="1:21.507" end="1:22.367">你封印在</span><span begin="1:22.367" end="1:22.835">我</span><span begin="1:22.835" end="1:23.059">的</span><span begin="1:23.059" end="1:24.788">心</span></p><p begin="1:25.010" end="1:31.745" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.010" end="1:25.620">让爱</span><span begin="1:25.620" end="1:26.107">再</span><span begin="1:26.107" end="1:26.549">继</span><span begin="1:26.549" end="1:27.820">续</span> <span begin="1:28.557" end="1:29.066">一命</span><span begin="1:29.066" end="1:29.526">一生</span><span begin="1:29.526" end="1:29.986">的</span><span begin="1:29.986" end="1:30.258">痕</span><span begin="1:30.258" end="1:31.745">迹</span></p><p begin="1:32.100" end="1:43.750" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.100" end="1:32.779">刻在</span><span begin="1:32.779" end="1:33.190">时</span><span begin="1:33.190" end="1:33.940">光</span><span begin="1:33.940" end="1:35.019">里</span> <span begin="1:35.584" end="1:36.582">最爱的人</span><span begin="1:36.582" end="1:37.996">就</span><span begin="1:37.996" end="1:38.604">是</span><span begin="1:38.604" end="1:43.750">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:52.771" end="2:43.937" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:52.771" end="2:06.180" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.771" end="1:54.005">人群中的</span><span begin="1:54.005" end="1:54.431">那</span><span begin="1:54.431" end="1:54.848">个</span><span begin="1:54.848" end="1:57.866">我</span> <span begin="1:59.981" end="2:00.758">微小得</span><span begin="2:00.758" end="2:01.635">好像</span><span begin="2:01.635" end="2:01.902">不</span><span begin="2:01.902" end="2:02.334">存</span><span begin="2:02.334" end="2:06.180">在</span></p><p begin="2:06.948" end="2:11.730" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.948" end="2:07.278">那些</span><span begin="2:07.278" end="2:07.763">说</span><span begin="2:07.763" end="2:08.048">过</span><span begin="2:08.048" end="2:08.650">的</span><span begin="2:08.650" end="2:08.929">幸</span><span begin="2:08.929" end="2:11.730">福</span></p><p begin="2:12.218" end="2:18.870" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.218" end="2:13.327">未来真的能</span><span begin="2:13.327" end="2:13.524">实</span><span begin="2:13.524" end="2:14.024">现</span> <span begin="2:14.024" end="2:14.713">是个</span><span begin="2:14.713" end="2:15.728">传说还是</span><span begin="2:15.728" end="2:16.034">预</span><span begin="2:16.034" end="2:18.870">言</span></p><p begin="2:19.243" end="2:25.952" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.243" end="2:20.128">写在风沙</span><span begin="2:20.128" end="2:20.640">星尘</span><span begin="2:20.640" end="2:21.109">中</span> <span begin="2:21.109" end="2:22.000">在迷雾</span><span begin="2:22.000" end="2:22.418">一样</span><span begin="2:22.418" end="2:22.835">的</span><span begin="2:22.835" end="2:23.088">世</span><span begin="2:23.088" end="2:25.952">界</span></p><p begin="2:26.391" end="2:29.750" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.391" end="2:27.248">我还唱着</span><span begin="2:27.248" end="2:27.487">我</span><span begin="2:27.487" end="2:27.685">的</span><span begin="2:27.685" end="2:28.071">歌</span> <span begin="2:28.071" end="2:28.263">只</span><span begin="2:28.263" end="2:28.752">希</span><span begin="2:28.752" end="2:28.997">望</span><span begin="2:28.997" end="2:29.237">有</span><span begin="2:29.237" end="2:29.432">一</span><span begin="2:29.432" end="2:29.750">天</span></p><p begin="2:29.938" end="2:33.199" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.938" end="2:30.321">你听</span><span begin="2:30.321" end="2:30.608">到</span><span begin="2:30.608" end="2:31.006">我想</span><span begin="2:31.006" end="2:31.222">说</span><span begin="2:31.222" end="2:31.498">的</span><span begin="2:31.498" end="2:31.874">一</span><span begin="2:31.874" end="2:33.199">切</span></p><p begin="2:33.349" end="2:43.937" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.349" end="2:34.551">什么都没有</span><span begin="2:34.551" end="2:35.460">改变过</span><span begin="2:35.460" end="2:36.197">我</span> <span begin="2:36.581" end="2:36.792">爱</span><span begin="2:36.792" end="2:37.133">着</span><span begin="2:37.13